<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n9131" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">collȳris</span></b> , ĭdis
			(<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">collȳrĭda</span></b> , ae, <i><span class="en">Vulg. 2 Reg. 6,
			19</span></i>; <i><span class="en">id. Lev. 8, 26</span></i>; cf.: cassida, chlamyda,
		etc.), f., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κολλυρίς</span>.
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>, <i>a roll</i> or <i>cake</i>, <i><span class="en">Aug.
				in Gen. 8, 5 <i>fin.</i></span></i>; <i><span class="en">Vulg. Lev. 7,
				12</span></i> (transl. of the Heb.
			).—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Meton.</b>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<i>A head-dress of women</i>,
				<i><span class="en">Tert. Cult. Fem. 2,
			7</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<i>A plant</i>, <i>also called</i> malva
			erratica, <i><span class="en">App. Herb. 40</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
